            "detailed_description": "<strong>Space is Crowded! Space is messy! Space is dangerous!</strong><br><br>As a member of the galactic space lane crew, it's your job to keep those lanes clear. This is no easy task, but with the help of your work-issued Mark-IV Astro Smasher Space Lane Maintenance Vehicle, you've got it covered.<br><br>This is an arcade-style, room-scale VR game where the player stands in the middle and guides a small spaceship around with the controllers to blast away space junk, repair failing satellites, and shoot down invading ships.<br><br><strong>An HTC Vive VR Headset is required to play!</strong>",
